    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # Uncomment and add your ORCID if you have one
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency, offline-first educational toolkit for running quantized
  local Large Language Models (Gemma 3, Qwen3) and embedding models
  (EmbeddingGemma) from a USB drive or local folder via KoboldCPP. Designed for
  university translation technology courses, linguistics labs, and privacy-sensitive
  localization workflows, the kit covers structured prompting, OpenAI-compatible
  REST API calls using the Python standard library, passage-level Vector RAG,
  concept-oriented ISO TBX terminology RAG, Graph RAG with entity alias
  resolution, and browser-based PCA embedding and knowledge-graph visualization.
